  "body": "Set on the flat in the sought-after Riverpark Estate, this comfortable brick and tile home offers a secure, easy-care lifestyle in Orewa. Peaceful, private and convenient, it's ideal for semi-retired or retired buyers looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nYou will love some of the key features of living here:\r\n\r\n*\tHome has ducted aircon in all bedrooms and a heat pump in the lounge\r\n*\tSunny, private and fully fenced back yard\r\n*\tFully tiled bathroom with underfloor heating\r\n*\tOrewa Estuary Walkway and Cycleway nearby, and handy to shops and beach\r\n\r\nIf you're ready to downsize and enjoy an easy, well-located lifestyle, this is an opportunity not to be missed. Call Lane today.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this information has been sourced from third parties. View our property information disclaimer here: raineandhorne.co.nz/property-disclaimer",
